Source for the firmware images
==============================

The images in `firmware/` are built from the `smk` repository
(https://github.com/mugi995/smk, GPL-2.0) with meson and SDCC.

| Image | Source |
| --- | --- |
| `leobog-hi75c_default-vial_smk.hex` (v0.6.1) | tag `v0.6.1` (commit `943dd07`) |
| `leobog-hi75c_default-via_smk.hex` | commit `4b685eb`; built from the same tree as commit `9389c89` |
| `leobog-hi75c_default_smk.hex` (v0.3.0) | commit `fc9fbb3` (branch `feat/leobog-hi75c`) |

The `smk` repository is the complete corresponding source: board support,
USB/VIA/Vial implementation, and the build files (meson, SDCC).
